**Security decisions implemented:**
- UUID validation prevents injection and path traversal
- Server-side session authentication (never trust client-provided identity)
- Ownership check in WHERE clause with 404 for non-owned resources
- RLS policies on documents table with no `USING (true)`
- Filename sanitization prevents header injection
- Structured error logging without sensitive data
- No credentials exposed to client (service role key stays server-side)
